---
pagination:
  data: langs
  size: 1
  alias: lang
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ lang.prefix }}/calendar/flyers/"
layout: base.njk
title_key: calendar.flyers.title
meta_title_key: calendar.flyers.meta_title
description_key: calendar.flyers.description
accent: coral
scripts: ["/assets/js/flyers.js"]
jsText: ["calendar.flyers.count_one", "calendar.flyers.count_n", "calendar.flyers.count_of"]
---
{#-
  /calendar/flyers/ — every upcoming event and meeting flyer (calendar.flyerWall, src/_data/calendar.js: the whole build
  window, 550 days ahead, and the one-time events further ahead that have a flyer: the "Further ahead" list of /events/).
  Reached from the "All event flyers" button and the "See every upcoming event flyer" link of /calendar/'s event
  flyers, and from the quick links of /events/. From the top:
    1. a slim header in the calendar's style: breadcrumbs (Home › Events › Event flyers, also given to search
       engines), title, share
    2. the filters (flyers.js, Alpine "flyerWall"): search, When (all upcoming · next 30 days · next 90 days · a month),
       Show (everything · events · regular meetings), Type, Language, Format, District. Nothing chosen = every card, and
       the choice is kept in the address (?when=90&type=workshop&lang=es&format=hybrid&district=d14&show=events&q=…), so
       a filtered view can be shared. Phones and tablets: the search box and a Filters button that opens the rest, and a
       "Show results" button (or Escape) at its foot that folds it again; from 1024px everything is open. Without JavaScript the bar is not shown (html:not(.js), until flyers.js marks the page
       .fw-ready) and every card is.
    3. Upcoming events, by month (Pacific time): one-time events, the repeating YPAA committees at their next date, and a
       single date with a flyer of its own. Every month in which one of the dates they carry falls has its group; the
       groups with no card at build time are sent hidden (and kept out of site search), for a repeating event that the
       browser moves on into them, or shows at its date in the month chosen in the When list.
    4. Regular meetings with flyers, each at its next date with its pattern ("Every 3rd Sunday").
  Cards: macros/events.njk eventCard, flyer variant with `gallery` — the picture opens the card's flyers full size
  (PhotoSwipe, app.js), the text links to the event page. Each card carries its coming dates (data-dates): flyers.js
  shows the next one as they pass, and app.js removes the card once its last date is over (data-hide-after), so the page
  stays right between builds. No build time is printed: an unchanged calendar gives the same page all day.
-#}
{%- from "macros/events.njk" import eventCard -%}
{%- from "macros/ui.njk" import breadcrumbLd, shareButton, emptyState -%}
{%- set L = lang -%}
{%- set W = calendar.flyerWall -%}
{%- set all = W.events.concat(W.meetings) -%}
{%- set firstKey = all[0].key if all.length else "" -%}
{#- the grid: one column on phones, 2 from 480px, 3 from 1024px, 4 from 1536px, 5 from 1920px (.ev-grid--flyer).
    Phones take the 640px file (the default): the 800px one (phoneMax: 800) is a little sharper on a phone's one card,
    but the first flyer then shows about a second later on a slow connection (owner's choice, Oct 30, 2026: speed) -#}
{%- set sizes = "(min-width: 1920px) 18vw, (min-width: 1536px) 22vw, (min-width: 1024px) 30vw, (min-width: 480px) 45vw, 92vw" -%}

{#- one card. first: the page's first picture (loaded at once, with high priority; the others lazily) -#}
{%- macro wallCard(c, L, sizes, level, first) -%}
{{ eventCard({ occ: c, lang: L, variant: "flyer", tag: "li", sizes: sizes, prio: "high" if first else "", level: level,
               gallery: c | calLoc("flyers", L), details: true, dates: c.dates, hideAfter: c.lastEnd,
               data: { "fw-card": c.key, "fw-kind": c.kind, "fw-type": c.typeSlug, "fw-lang": c.langKey, "fw-format": c.formatKey,
                       "fw-districts": (c.districts or []) | join(" "), "search": c.search } }) }}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#- ---------------------------------------------------------- slim page header -#}
<section class="cal-hero relative isolate overflow-hidden" style="{{ 'coral' | accent }}">
  <div class="cal-hero__bg absolute inset-0 -z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="bg-confetti absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-60" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <img src="/assets/img/logo/logo-{{ L.code }}-256.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="256" height="256" loading="lazy"
       class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 right-6 -z-10 hidden size-56 rotate-12 opacity-[0.07] lg:block 2xl:right-16">
  <div class="wrap pt-4 pb-6 sm:pt-5 lg:pt-6 lg:pb-8">
    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <nav aria-label="{{ 'nav.breadcrumb' | t(L) }}" class="min-w-0 text-sm">
        <ol class="-my-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 text-ink-600 lg:my-0 lg:gap-y-1.5">
          <li><a href="{{ '/' | lurl(L) }}" class="-ml-3.5 inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center hover:text-ink-900 lg:ml-0 lg:size-auto">{% icon "house", "size-4" %}<span class="sr-only">{{ "nav.home" | t(L) }}</span></a></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">{% icon "chevron-right", "size-3.5 text-ink-300" %}<a href="{{ '/calendar/' | lurl(L) }}" class="inline-flex min-h-11 min-w-11 items-center justify-center hover:text-ink-900 lg:min-h-0 lg:min-w-0">{{ "calendar.title" | t(L) }}</a></li>
          <li class="flex min-h-11 min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 lg:min-h-0">{% icon "chevron-right", "size-3.5 text-ink-300" %}<span class="truncate font-medium text-ink-800" aria-current="page">{{ title }}</span></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      {{ shareButton({ lang: L, title: title, style: "pill" }) }}
    </div>
    {{ breadcrumbLd({ lang: L, crumbs: [{ label_key: "calendar.title", url: "/calendar/" }], title: title, base: site.url }) }}
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-10 gap-y-4">
      <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[20rem] items-center gap-4">
        <span class="icon-tile hidden size-12 shrink-0 rounded-2xl sm:grid lg:size-14">{% icon "images", "size-6 lg:size-7" %}</span>
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-balance text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl" data-pagefind-weight="10">{{ title }}</h1>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-pretty text-ink-600 sm:text-base">{{ "calendar.flyers.lead" | t(L) }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="{{ '/calendar/' | lurl(L) }}" class="btn btn-white shrink-0 max-sm:hidden">{% icon "calendar-days", "size-4 text-ocean-600" %}{{ "calendar.open_calendar" | t(L) }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if all.length %}
<div x-data="flyerWall" class="fw-page wrap pt-6 pb-16 sm:pt-8 lg:pt-10 lg:pb-20">
  {#- ---------------------------------------------------------- filters (with JavaScript only) -#}
  <form class="fw-bar" role="search" aria-label="{{ 'calendar.flyers.filters_label' | t(L) }}" @submit.prevent data-pagefind-ignore>
    <div class="fw-bar__top">
      <label class="cal-search fw-search">
        {% icon "search", "size-5 shrink-0 text-ink-500" %}
        <span class="sr-only">{{ "calendar.flyers.search_label" | t(L) }}</span>
        <input type="search" x-model.debounce.250ms="f.q" placeholder="{{ 'calendar.flyers.search' | t(L) }}" autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search">
      </label>
      <button type="button" class="cal-filter-btn fw-toggle" @click="open = !open" aria-expanded="false" :aria-expanded="open.toString()" aria-controls="fw-panel">
        {% icon "sliders-horizontal", "size-4" %}{{ "ui.filters" | t(L) }}<span class="cal-filter-btn__n" x-cloak x-show="activeCount() > 0" x-text="activeCount()"></span>
      </button>
      <p class="fw-count"><strong x-text="countText()">{{ ("calendar.flyers.count_one" | t(L)) if all.length == 1 else ("calendar.flyers.count_n" | t(L, { n: all.length })) }}</strong></p>
      <button type="button" class="cal-clear" x-cloak x-show="activeCount() > 0" @click="clear()">{{ "calendar.flyers.clear" | t(L) }}</button>
    </div>
    <p class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" x-text="announce"></p>

    <div id="fw-panel" class="fw-panel" :class="open && 'is-open'" @keydown.escape="if (open) { $event.stopPropagation(); done() }">
      {#- ---- when: all upcoming (default) · next 30 / 90 days · a month with an event -#}
      <fieldset class="fw-group">
        <legend class="flt-legend">{{ "calendar.flyers.when" | t(L) }}</legend>
        <div class="flt-pills">
          {%- for w in [{ v: "", key: "calendar.flyers.when_all", icon: "calendar-days" }, { v: "30", key: "calendar.flyers.when_30", icon: "calendar-clock" }, { v: "90", key: "calendar.flyers.when_90", icon: "calendar-range" }] %}
          <label class="flt-pill" style="{{ 'ocean' | accent }}">
            <input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="fw-when" value="{{ w.v }}" x-model="f.when"{% if not w.v %} checked{% endif %}>
            <span class="flt-pill__in">{% icon w.icon, "size-3.5" %}{{ w.key | t(L) }}<span class="flt-pill__n" x-text="facet('when', {{ w.v | json }})">{{ all.length if not w.v }}</span></span>
          </label>
          {%- endfor %}
          {%- if W.months.length %}
          <label class="fw-month-pick">
            <span class="sr-only">{{ "calendar.flyers.month" | t(L) }}</span>
            <select class="flt-select" data-fw-months :value="monthValue()" @change="f.when = $event.target.value">
              <option value="">{{ "calendar.flyers.any_month" | t(L) }}</option>
              {%- for m in W.months %}
              {#- a choice starts with a capital ("Octubre de 2026"), as the month headings do -#}
              {%- set ml = m.key | dt("month", L) | capitalize %}
              <option value="{{ m.key }}" :disabled="facet('month', {{ m.key | json }}) === 0 && f.when !== {{ m.key | json }}" x-text="optLabel({{ ml | json }}, 'month', {{ m.key | json }})">{{ ml }}</option>
              {%- endfor %}
            </select>
          </label>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      {#- ---- show: everything (default) · events · regular meetings -#}
      <fieldset class="fw-group">
        <legend class="flt-legend">{{ "calendar.flyers.show" | t(L) }}</legend>
        <div class="flt-pills">
          {%- for s in [{ v: "", key: "calendar.flyers.show_all", icon: "images", color: "iris" }, { v: "events", key: "calendar.flyers.show_events", icon: "sparkles", color: "coral" }, { v: "meetings", key: "calendar.events.meetings", icon: "repeat", color: "sea" }] %}
          <label class="flt-pill" style="{{ s.color | accent }}">
            <input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="fw-show" value="{{ s.v }}" x-model="f.show"{% if not s.v %} checked{% endif %}>
            <span class="flt-pill__in">{% icon s.icon, "size-3.5" %}{{ s.key | t(L) }}<span class="flt-pill__n" x-text="facet('show', {{ s.v | json }})">{{ (all.length if not s.v else (W.events.length if s.v == "events" else W.meetings.length)) }}</span></span>
          </label>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      {#- ---- language and format: any of the chosen -#}
      <fieldset class="fw-group">
        <legend class="flt-legend">{{ "calendar.filters.language" | t(L) }}</legend>
        <div class="flt-pills">
          {%- for lg in [{ k: "en", key: "language.english", color: "sea" }, { k: "es", key: "language.spanish", color: "coral" }, { k: "bi", key: "language.bilingual", color: "sun" }] %}
          <label class="flt-pill" style="{{ lg.color | accent }}">
            <input type="checkbox" class="sr-only" value="{{ lg.k }}" x-model="f.langs">
            <span class="flt-pill__in">{% icon "languages", "size-3.5" %}{{ lg.key | t(L) }}<span class="flt-pill__n" x-text="facet('langs', {{ lg.k | json }})">{{ all | where("langKey", lg.k) | length }}</span></span>
          </label>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset class="fw-group">
        <legend class="flt-legend">{{ "calendar.filters.format" | t(L) }}</legend>
        <div class="flt-pills">
          {%- for fm in [{ k: "in-person", key: "format.in_person", icon: "map-pin", color: "sage" }, { k: "hybrid", key: "format.hybrid", icon: "monitor-smartphone", color: "iris" }, { k: "online", key: "format.virtual", icon: "video", color: "ocean" }] %}
          <label class="flt-pill" style="{{ fm.color | accent }}">
            <input type="checkbox" class="sr-only" value="{{ fm.k }}" x-model="f.formats">
            <span class="flt-pill__in">{% icon fm.icon, "size-3.5" %}{{ fm.key | t(L) }}<span class="flt-pill__n" x-text="facet('formats', {{ fm.k | json }})">{{ all | where("formatKey", fm.k) | length }}</span></span>
          </label>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      {#- ---- type and district: only those the flyers have -#}
      <div class="fw-group fw-selects">
        <label class="block min-w-0">
          <span class="flt-legend">{{ "calendar.flyers.type" | t(L) }}</span>
          <select class="flt-select" data-fw-types x-model="f.type">
            <option value="">{{ "calendar.flyers.all_types" | t(L) }}</option>
            {%- for ty in W.types %}
            {%- set tl = ty | calLoc("label", L) %}
            <option value="{{ ty.slug }}" x-text="optLabel({{ tl | json }}, 'type', {{ ty.slug | json }})">{{ tl }}</option>
            {%- endfor %}
          </select>
        </label>
        {%- if W.districts.length %}
        <label class="block min-w-0">
          <span class="flt-legend">{{ "calendar.filters.district" | t(L) }}</span>
          <select class="flt-select" data-fw-districts x-model="f.district">
            <option value="">{{ "calendar.filters.all_districts" | t(L) }}</option>
            {%- for d in W.districts %}
            {%- set dlab = d | calLoc("label", L) %}
            <option value="{{ d.slug }}" x-text="optLabel({{ dlab | json }}, 'district', {{ d.slug | json }})">{{ dlab }}</option>
            {%- endfor %}
          </select>
        </label>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>

      {#- phones and tablets: fold the filters away and go back to the flyers (Escape does the same) -#}
      <div class="fw-panel__foot">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ocean flex-1" @click="done()">
          {{ "calendar.filters.show" | t(L) }} <span class="rounded-full bg-white/25 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs" x-text="Math.max(shown, 0)">{{ all.length }}</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </form>

  {#- the target of "Clear filters" in the empty state (the button goes away) -#}
  <div x-ref="results" tabindex="-1" class="fw-results">
    {#- ---------------------------------------------------------- events, by month -#}
    <section id="events" class="fw-section scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="fw-events-title" data-fw-section{% if not W.events.length %} hidden{% endif %}>
      <div class="fw-section__head">
        <h2 id="fw-events-title" class="h-section text-balance">{{ "calendar.events.upcoming" | t(L) }}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-2 text-pretty">{{ "calendar.flyers.events_lead" | t(L) }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fw-months">
      {%- for m in W.months %}
      {#- the heading is the month alone (its name for screen readers and its title in site search); the count beside it
          is for the eye (a list says how many items it has) -#}
      <section class="fw-month" data-fw-month="{{ m.key }}" aria-labelledby="fw-m-{{ m.key }}"{% if not m.cards.length %} hidden data-pagefind-ignore="all"{% endif %}>
        <div class="fw-month__title"><h3 id="fw-m-{{ m.key }}" class="first-letter:uppercase">{{ m.key | dt("month", L) }}</h3><span class="chip chip-accent" data-fw-n aria-hidden="true" data-pagefind-ignore>{{ m.cards.length }}</span></div>
        <ul class="ev-grid ev-grid--flyer" role="list" data-fw-list>
          {%- for c in m.cards %}
          {{ wallCard(c, L, sizes, 4, c.key == firstKey) }}
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </section>
      {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    {#- ---------------------------------------------------------- regular meetings -#}
    <section id="meetings" class="fw-section scroll-mt-28" aria-labelledby="fw-meetings-title" data-fw-section{% if not W.meetings.length %} hidden{% endif %}>
      <div class="fw-section__head">
        <h2 id="fw-meetings-title" class="h-section text-balance">{{ "calendar.flyers.meetings_title" | t(L) }}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-2 text-pretty">{{ "calendar.flyers.meetings_lead" | t(L) }}</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="ev-grid ev-grid--flyer" role="list" data-fw-list>
        {%- for c in W.meetings %}
        {{ wallCard(c, L, sizes, 3, c.key == firstKey) }}
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    {#- nothing matches the filters -#}
    <div class="ev-empty" x-cloak x-show="shown === 0">
      <span class="icon-tile-soft size-11">{% icon "search-x", "size-5" %}</span>
      <p><strong class="block text-ink-900">{{ "calendar.flyers.empty_title" | t(L) }}</strong>{{ "calendar.flyers.empty_body" | t(L) }}</p>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" @click="clear(true)">{% icon "x", "size-4" %}{{ "calendar.flyers.clear" | t(L) }}</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
    <a href="{{ '/calendar/' | lurl(L) }}" class="btn btn-ghost">{% icon "calendar-days", "size-4" %}{{ "calendar.open_calendar" | t(L) }}</a>
    <a href="{{ '/events/' | lurl(L) }}" class="btn btn-ghost">{% icon "list", "size-4" %}{{ "calendar.featured.all" | t(L) }}</a>
  </div>
</div>
{%- else %}
<div class="wrap py-16 lg:py-20">
  {{ emptyState({ icon: "images", title: "calendar.flyers.none" | t(L), color: "coral" }) }}
  <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
    <a href="{{ '/calendar/' | lurl(L) }}" class="btn btn-ghost">{% icon "calendar-days", "size-4" %}{{ "calendar.open_calendar" | t(L) }}</a>
  </div>
</div>
{%- endif %}
